import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 325 | Perfect-World Energy-Waste Analysis: Emperor-Immortal-Tier Aptitude Used for Single-Handed Autocracy Over Eternity","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 325 | Perfect-World Energy-Waste Analysis: Emperor-Immortal-Tier Aptitude Used for Single-Handed Autocracy Over Eternity","no":325,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Shi Hao","Energy-Level Waste","Emperor Immortal","Single-Handed Autocracy"],"related":["17-Plane Transcendent Standards","15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0325_模块2-完美世界-仙帝级资质用于独断万古.md","filePath":"en/0325_模块2-完美世界-仙帝级资质用于独断万古.md"}'),a={name:"en/0325_模块2-完美世界-仙帝级资质用于独断万古.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,c,u){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-325-perfect-world-energy-waste-analysis-emperor-immortal-tier-aptitude-used-for-single-handed-autocracy-over-eternity" tabindex="-1">Entry 325 | Perfect-World Energy-Waste Analysis: Emperor-Immortal-Tier Aptitude Used for Single-Handed Autocracy Over Eternity <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-325-perfect-world-energy-waste-analysis-emperor-immortal-tier-aptitude-used-for-single-handed-autocracy-over-eternity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 325 | Perfect-World Energy-Waste Analysis: Emperor-Immortal-Tier Aptitude Used for Single-Handed Autocracy Over Eternity&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-World Full Decomposition (Entry 2) | Benchmark base: Documents 17, 15, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-highest-tier-power-loneliest-use" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Highest-tier power, loneliest use <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-highest-tier-power-loneliest-use" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Highest-tier power, loneliest use&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou judges a strong one not by how high he can fight, but by how much civilization stock his energy converts into. Shi Hao is a Myriad-Realms ceiling-tier Emperor Immortal, yet converts nearly all this cosmos-tier energy into &quot;one person&#39;s battle.&quot; This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — item by item anatomizing Perfect World&#39;s energy waste. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s energy waste is not a capability problem, but a direction problem, concentrated in four dimensions:</p><ul><li><strong>Civilization-engineering dimension</strong>: Emperor Immortal-tier power could have been used to re-cosmic laws, open increment Origin, establish cross-era night-watch institutions; actually used to &quot;personally stepping out again and again.&quot; Equivalent to holding the law-amendment right, yet spending a lifetime as a firefighter</li><li><strong>Time dimension</strong>: Shi Hao&#39;s long campaigning lifespan is heavily consumed in one-on-one dark-source battles, alone patching samsara gaps. The same energy invested in institutional construction could have freed Myriad Ranks from night-watcher dependence within a century</li><li><strong>Talent dimension</strong>: Liu Shen, Myriad-Realms comrades, Stone Village juniors could have been cultivated into second-tier, echelon &quot;rotating night watch&quot;; actually mostly foils, sacrifices, or exits; strong-one capacity one-time consumed</li><li><strong>Knowledge dimension</strong>: the complete self-seed path, key cognition of single-handedly deciding eternity, not precipitated in a copyable, teachable, Alaya-archivable form</li></ul><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou terminology: this is typical &quot;great-material-small-use&quot; and &quot;energy mismatch&quot; — Emperor Immortal-tier aptitude compressed into a blade only drawn at critical moments.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy mismatch necessarily leads to regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Night-watcher dependence solidified</strong>: Myriad Ranks accustomed to &quot;wait for Shi Hao when darkness comes&quot;; their own evolution stagnates</li><li><strong>Institutional vacuum</strong>: Shi Hao&#39;s military exploits not converted into laws; he exits and darkness immediately returns</li><li><strong>Era break</strong>: Shrouding era, Sacred Ruins era still must re-face the same kind of darkness, equivalent to making later generations redo the same hard problem</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s &quot;self-seed&quot; seems to need no external seeking, actually is the most efficient stock devouring:</p><ul><li>One person&#39;s seed drains cave-heavens, divine materials, era fortune</li><li>Key battlefield opportunities are strongly exclusionary</li><li>He pours all predated energy into personal combat power, not back into Myriad Ranks</li></ul><p>This is the most tragic sample of &quot;predating for justice.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Perfect World Energy Direction</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Emperor Immortal personally steps out to night-watch</td><td>Alaya early warning + multi-layer supervision, collective disposal</td></tr><tr><td>Self-seed private path</td><td>300 Origin systems all-tier public</td></tr><tr><td>Comrades as foils and sacrifices</td><td>20% Activation Strategy, echelon night watchmen in waves</td></tr><tr><td>Military exploits not precipitated into laws</td><td>Military exploits written into charter and law network</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate Perfect World energy-flow parameters</li><li>Inject two cases — &quot;Shi Hao personally fights&quot; vs. &quot;Shi Hao institutionally distributes&quot;</li><li>Count civilization stock output per unit energy</li><li>Output &quot;Perfect World Energy-Conversion-Rate Comparison Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Eighteen-layer span between Emperor Immortal tier and mortal tier; energy leaps lack verifiable law steps</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Emperor Immortal combat power repeatedly inflates with plot, multi-part revised</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: converting &quot;Emperor Immortal-tier aptitude used for single-handed autocracy over eternity&quot; into a civilization ledger makes this waste&#39;s depth clearer. Suppose one Emperor Immortal-tier strong one&#39;s energy suffices to rebuild the cosmic law network, but is actually used only to block one dark tide, then civilization stock output per unit energy approaches zero. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s practice is the opposite: Origin Realm strong ones after four-dimension assessment enter posts, continuously converting energy into cross-era institutional construction, knowledge archiving, and Myriad-Rank feedback. The same energy: the former spends and is gone; the latter earns compound interest. This is solitary autocracy vs. symbiosis&#39;s fundamental gap in energy economics.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Emperor Immortal-tier aptitude compressed into personal combat power, civilization-engineering dimension nearly idle</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: self-seed devours one realm&#39;s stock without feedback</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least uses energy to run schools for universal benefit; Shi Hao uses energy to alone hold darkness</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: night-watch ability not diffused to Myriad Ranks; Myriad Ranks long-term in &quot;protected&quot; state</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: energy usage within a closed era cannot support multiverse expansion</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s strength is beyond doubt, but &quot;strongest&quot; and &quot;most economical&quot; are two different things. What Heng Yuan Zhou asks is: a cosmos that needs an Emperor Immortal to spend a lifetime of energy on personally stepping out — did it get the energy direction wrong from the start?</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · Emperor-Immortal-tier aptitude used for single-handed autocracy over eternity described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./324_模块2-完美世界-石昊孤道与独木式文明定性.html">Entry 324 · Overview</a> · <a href="./326_模块2-完美世界-石昊之后文明即断代.html">Entry 326 · Inevitable Historical Regression</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,g as default};
